# Spec contract

Every Feature is `spec/<slug>/` with `spec.md`, `tests/*.feature`, `tasks.md`, and `review.md`.

Write the Gherkin spec before executing Tasks. Scaffold from `spec/_templates/feature/` via `new-feature`.

“Tests pass” (until a runner ADR): see `process/glossary.md`.
